  <h2>The crossover, charted</h2>

  <section class="prose">
    <p>On a logarithmic scale — required, because the iPhone went from a Geekbench 6 equivalent of ~15 to ~3,895 — the shape of the curve is what matters. The purple line gets steeper while the gray line maintains a roughly constant slope. The iPhone wasn't keeping pace with the Mac. It was accelerating <em>relative to</em> it.</p>
